	]
	quest.4F9DA666CA118ECA.quest_subtitle: "击败 &6The Eye&r 后，现实会撕裂，开启通往 The &k&4l&r&0&lVoid&r&k&4l &rdimension 的传送门。右键此传送门以挑战 The &k&4l&r&0&lVoid Shadow&r&k&4l &r"
	quest.504F4795C536CA77.quest_subtitle: "放置在作物上方时，会减弱季节的影响。"
